Z||000000||firstfiero||07-03-2001||11:54 PM||||    I know it's not good for my car but their is nothing I enjoy more then running the rpms up,hereing the red head roar behind me....AND POP! goes the clutch. The tires start spinning trying to get grip as the rear end just comes right out from under ya! You let it go till you get right at that point where if you don't pull her back your going to be facing in the opposite direction. All I can say is FUN,FUN,FUN! I try to spend as much time side ways as possible! I think it's because this is the first car I've owned with such a great tendency to fish tail with the greatest of ease. Am I alone here?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
